          "id": "q10",
          "question": "FCFS, SJF and STCF scheduling numerical",
          "answer": "Given: P1 (AT=0, BT=8), P2 (AT=1, BT=5), P3 (AT=3, BT=3), P4 (AT=4, BT=1), P5 (AT=6, BT=4).\n\n Use TAT = CT − AT and WT = TAT − BT.\n\n A. FCFS – First Come First Serve\n FCFS is non-preemptive. Processes execute in order of arrival: P1 → P2 → P3 → P4 → P5.\n\n                           P1                              P2                        P3        P4               P5\n\n 0 8 13 16 17 21\n\n  Process                  AT                  BT           CT                  TAT                  WT\n\n  P1                       0                   8            8                   8                    0\n\n  P2                       1                   5            13                  12                   7\n\n  P3                       3                   3            16                  13                   10\n\nOPERATING SYSTEMS | UNIT 2\n\n\n\n\n  Process              AT                   BT                   CT                  TAT                  WT\n\n  P4                   4                    1                    17                  13                   12\n\n  P5                   6                    4                    21                  15                   11\n\n  Total                                                                              61                   40\n\n\n Average TAT = 61 ÷ 5 = 12.2 units\n Average WT = 40 ÷ 5 = 8 units\n\n B. SJF – Shortest Job First (non-preemptive)\n SJF selects the available process with the shortest burst time. At time 0 only P1 is available, so it runs first. At time 8,\n the order is P4, P3, P5 and P2.\n\n                        P1                         P4          P3                    P5                         P2\n\n 0 8 9 12 16 21\n\n  Process              AT                   BT                   CT                  TAT                  WT\n\n  P1                   0                    8                    8                   8                    0\n\n  P2                   1                    5                    21                  20                   15\n\n  P3                   3                    3                    12                  9                    6\n\n  P4                   4                    1                    9                   5                    4\n\n  P5                   6                    4                    16                  10                   6\n\n  Total                                                                              52                   31\n\n\n Average TAT = 52 ÷ 5 = 10.4 units\n Average WT = 31 ÷ 5 = 6.2 units\n\n C. STCF – Shortest Time-to-Completion First (preemptive)\n STCF is the preemptive version of SJF. The process with the shortest remaining time runs. If a shorter job arrives, it\n can preempt the current process. When remaining times tie, this solution lets the current process continue.\n\n Execution: P1 (0–1), P2 (1–4), P4 (4–5), P2 (5–7), P3 (7–10), P5 (10–14), P1 (14–21).\n\n   P1             P2         P4     P2             P3                    P5                               P1\n\n 0 1 4 5 7 10 14 21\n\n  Process              AT                   BT                   CT                  TAT                  WT\n\n  P1                   0                    8                    21                  21                   13\n\n  P2                   1                    5                    7                   6                    1\n\n  P3                   3                    3                    10                  7                    4\n\n  P4                   4                    1                    5                   1                    0\n\n  P5                   6                    4                    14                  8                    4\n\n  Total                                                                              43                   22\n\n\n Average TAT = 43 ÷ 5 = 8.6 units\n Average WT = 22 ÷ 5 = 4.4 units\n\n Final comparison\n\nOPERATING SYSTEMS | UNIT 2\n\n\n\n\n  Algorithm                                 Average TAT                                 Average WT\n\n  FCFS                                      12.2                                        8.0\n\n  SJF                                       10.4                                        6.2\n\n  STCF                                      8.6                                         4.4\n\n\n Conclusion: For this set of processes, STCF gives the lowest average waiting time and turnaround time."
